WEBVTT

00:09:57.829 --> 00:10:00.412
an average-looking man of average size.

00:10:01.162 --> 00:10:03.912
He wore black and white,
slippers over socks,

00:10:03.954 --> 00:10:06.079
pilling sweatpants, a piebald sweater,

00:10:06.079 --> 00:10:08.371
a striped ski cap
pulled down to his forehead.

00:10:09.329 --> 00:10:11.579
He'd been expecting me,
Mohamed had phoned.

00:10:11.621 --> 00:10:13.121
And so at once,

00:10:13.162 --> 00:10:16.162
we shook hands, and smiled,

00:10:16.204 --> 00:10:17.871
and I gave him my gift,

00:10:17.871 --> 00:10:19.871
and he told me I was a guest in his home,

00:10:19.871 --> 00:10:22.371
and we sat beside one another
on a fabric couch.

00:10:22.871 --> 00:10:25.579
It was then that Abed resumed at once

00:10:25.579 --> 00:10:29.329
the tale of woe he had begun
over the phone 16 years before.